This is a list of Pokémon in the order dictated by the [[Pokopia]] [[regional Pokédex|Pokédex]]. There are 300 numbered Pokémon in the main Pokopia Pokédex, all which are directly available in the game and required for Pokédex completion. There is also a [[List of Pokémon by Pokédex (Event) number in Pokémon Pokopia|separate Pokédex]] for Pokémon added through events, and a [[List of Pokémon by Pokédex (Basin) number in Pokémon Pokopia|separate Pokédex]] for Pokémon added in the [[Pokémon Pokopia Expansion Pass|Expansion Pass]], which have independent lists from this Pokédex. The '''Cloud Island Pokédex''' filled out when visiting Cloud Islands follows an identical list to the Pokédex used in the main game.

