==Trivia==
[[File:Pokopia Spinarak oversight.png|thumb|250px|{{p|Spinarak}} listed as a pure {{t|Bug}} type]]
* Due to an oversight, {{p|Spinarak}} was originally listed in this Pokédex as a pure {{t|Bug}} type; this was fixed in patch 1.0.2 on March 17, 2026.
* This is the first Pokédex to feature {{p|Kyogre}} without {{p|Groudon}}, {{p|Tatsugiri}} without {{p|Dondozo}}, and the {{p|Fidough}} line without the {{p|Maschiff}} and {{p|Greavard}} lines.
* At least one [[first partner Pokémon]] line from every [[generation]] appears in the Pokopia Pokédex.
** The trio of [[Kanto first partner Pokémon]] is the only one that is featured in its entirety.
* {{p|Wooper}} is the only Pokémon in the Pokopia Pokédex to appear as a [[regional form]].
* {{p|Kleavor}} is the only Pokémon with an evolutionary relative in the Pokopia Pokédex that is not featured in it.
** {{p|Quagsire}}, [[Perrserker (Pokémon)|Perrserker]], {{p|Sirfetch'd}}, and {{p|Mr. Rime}} are a similar case, but they evolve from forms of Pokémon that are not in the Pokopia Pokédex (namely regular Wooper, {{rf|Galarian}} [[Meowth (Pokémon)|Meowth]], Galarian {{p|Farfetch'd}}, and Galarian {{p|Mr. Mime}}).
* {{p|Klink}} does not appear in the Pokopia Pokédex, despite appearing as the icon for the [[Options|Settings]] menu.
{{-}}

